IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `epma-pollution`

-- Environmental Protection and Management Act 1999, ss 6, 9, 11, 15, 17, 22, 27, 28, 35, 49, 67, 72 and First Schedule -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_environmental-protection-and-management-act-1999.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

